      "content": "those make sense too. though i was thinking about how some people argue that things like individual responsibility, tradition, and even a certain level of skepticism or self-reliance are actually the core virtues that keep a democracy stable. do you feel like those are missing from your list, or are they just not as relevant anymore?",
